SUMMARY:Vinyl Sunday: Stanley Mouse Appreciation Day
DESCRIPTION:Vinyl Sunday Presents: Stanley Mouse Appreciation Day 2026. Sunday\, August 9 join us at Sixteen 600 as we turn the tasting house into a Stanley Mouse gallery. Where’s West will be playing music on the back deck\, and food will be available from Allikai Eatery. Come hang out\, drink wine\, dance a little\, and have the chance to meet our beloved label artist. \nLocated at Winery Sixteen 600\, 589 First Street West\, Sonoma\, CA 95476. \nTickets: $42 general | Free for Phil Sent Me members \nFlights of wine included in all tickets \nQuestions? Give us a call or text us at (707) 721-1805\, or email sam@winerysixteen600.com
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/vinyl-sunday-stanley-mouse-appreciation-day/
LOCATION:Winery Sixteen 600\, 589 First Street West\, Sonoma\, CA
CATEGORIES:Art,Music
END:VEVENT
